Operational Features
​Automated Document Generation: Compiles financial data and LaTeX ledger templates into PDF formats.
​Dispute & Legal Clearance Logs: Stores official dealership settlement notices, NOC certificates, and audit logs.
​Real-time Inventory Sync: Tracks goods allocation between the central warehouse and regional retail outlets.
